D16 (gromosXX 247c95c4): A-EDS energy columns written after the parameter search.
md++/src/algorithm/integration/eds.cc:368-372 set eds_emax, eds_emin and eds_eir after the search update (:178-366), while
eds_vmix and eds_vr (:100, :122-134) were computed with the values before it: a frame's V_R* cannot be rebuilt from the same
frame's e_i, e_ir, eds_emax and eds_emin (the LiveCoMS t_05 scripts/search.py does exactly that). Fix: write the three right
after V_R*, i.e. the values this step used; eds_globmin and eds_globminfluc stay this step's search statistics.

diff --git a/md++/src/algorithm/integration/eds.cc b/md++/src/algorithm/integration/eds.cc
--- a/md++/src/algorithm/integration/eds.cc
+++ b/md++/src/algorithm/integration/eds.cc
@@ -133,6 +133,13 @@
         conf.current().energies.eds_vr = conf.current().energies.eds_vmix - 0.5 * kfac * demix * demix;
       }
 
+      // the E_max, E_min and offsets this step's V_mix and V_R* were computed with
+      conf.current().energies.eds_emax = sim.param().eds.emax;
+      conf.current().energies.eds_emin = sim.param().eds.emin;
+      for (unsigned int is = 0; is < numstates; is++) {
+        conf.current().energies.eds_eir[is] = sim.param().eds.eir[is];
+      }
+
       // calculate eds contribution ...
       for (unsigned int state = 0; state < numstates; state++) {
         const long double pi = exp(prefactors[state] - sum_prefactors);
@@ -363,14 +370,6 @@
         }
       }
       
